# Molten-Core Maestro's opus when the Maestro is gone (CR 400.7, 608.2h): Bot1 casts Mind Twist with X = 4 (five mana) and the opus
# trigger goes on the stack; Bot2 answers with Lightning Bolt on the 2/2 Maestro, which dies. The trigger resolves anyway: there is
# no creature to put a counter on, and the amount of {R} is the power the Maestro last had on the battlefield, 2 - not 3, as the
# counter was never put on. So {R}{R} is in the pool.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Molten-Core Maestro
Mind Twist
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Plains x18

